{"4073740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WeAreSecurity", "steam_appid": 4073740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WeAreSecurity</strong> is a minimalist, atmospheric horror game where you're a worker monitoring camera feeds on an aging desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At first you are assigned with two cameras to watch. If you have good performance then two more cameras to watch will be added until  a max of eight cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The things you are observing in the cameras are not human. If you see any of these things then make sure to report them so they can be corrected. Don't waste company resources with false reports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you perform well enough with the max amount of cameras then you might be considered for<strong> </strong>employee of the month or even earn a promotion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you make too many mistakes you will not  advance to the next cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Malfunctioning cameras can be fixed by turning them off and back on. As the days past the cameras tend to get less reliable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are an employee for <strong>WeAreSecurity</strong>. <i><strong>Strive to be the best employee!</strong></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WeAreSecurity</strong> is a minimalist, atmospheric horror game where you're a worker monitoring camera feeds on an aging desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At first you are assigned with two cameras to watch. If you have good performance then two more cameras to watch will be added until  a max of eight cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The things you are observing in the cameras are not human. If you see any of these things then make sure to report them so they can be corrected. Don't waste company resources with false reports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you perform well enough with the max amount of cameras then you might be considered for<strong> </strong>employee of the month or even earn a promotion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you make too many mistakes you will not  advance to the next cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Malfunctioning cameras can be fixed by turning them off and back on. As the days past the cameras tend to get less reliable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are an employee for <strong>WeAreSecurity</strong>. <i><strong>Strive to be the best employee!</strong></i></p>", "short_description": "A psychological horror game that takes place in an aging desktop where you have to monitor surveillance feeds. Your job is to report any feeds that show unnatural activity while restarting the cameras to keep them active. Become the best employee.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073740/283fd02c23cb593f621a3701475f667b248445e2/header.jpg?t=1768443016", "capsule